Description: Local CPU llama.cpp runtime for Sentia
 Native local inference runtime package for Sentia Linux.
 .
 This package configures llama.cpp for portable CPU execution with dynamic
 backend dispatch and multiple CPU variants, while keeping local model serving
 constrained to a private Unix socket service profile.
